    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Amentum Services?",
      "a": "The Department of Defense, the Department of Homeland Security, and the General Services Administration are the top buyers. The Department of Defense obligated $1.8B, the Department of Homeland Security obligated $733M, and the General Services Administration obligated $102M. Other agencies with obligations include the Department of the Treasury at $87.3M and the Department of State at $29.3M."
    },
    {
      "q": "What does Amentum Services sell to the government?",
      "a": "Amentum Services sells services in aviation support, security, engineering, facilities, and IT operations. Other Support Activities for Air Transportation accounts for $990M, Security Guards and Patrol Services accounts for $507M, and Engineering Services accounts for $339M. Facilities Support Services and Computer Facilities Management Services account for $250M and $125M respectively."
